---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import { profile, projects, skills } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout><div class="container home">
<section class="hero" id="about"><div class="hero-main reveal"><p class="kicker">{profile.role}</p><h1>让模型<br /><em>真正跑起来。</em></h1><p class="hero-lede">我是 {profile.chineseName}（Bailey Huang），一名自动化专业本科生。专注于端侧 AI 部署、模型推理优化与多模态智能系统，把实验室里的模型推进到真实设备。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#projects">查看项目 <span>↓</span></a><a class="button" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>联系我 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-tags"><span>Model deployment</span><span>Computer vision</span><span>AI systems</span></div></div><div class="hero-aside reveal"><div class="hero-card"><div class="hero-card-top"><span>01 / FOCUS</span><span>2026</span></div><h2>Edge AI<br /><strong>in practice.</strong></h2><div class="hero-rule"></div><p class="mono-label">CURRENTLY WORKING ON</p><ul><li>模型量化与端侧推理</li><li>多模态视频理解</li><li>AI 基础设施与调度</li></ul><div class="hero-location"><span>Xi'an</span><span>·</span><span>Shenzhen</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="signal-grid reveal" aria-label="关键成果"><div><strong>79 → 85%</strong><span>Top-1 accuracy</span></div><div><strong>2 × 5090D</strong><span>Local AI platform</span></div><div><strong>国家级一等奖</strong><span>Challenge Cup AI track</span></div><div><strong>IELTS 7.0</strong><span>Technical English</span></div></section>
<div class="content-grid"><aside class="profile-column" id="contact"><div class="profile-block reveal"><p class="section-label">Profile</p><p>{profile.description}</p><dl><dt>Education</dt><dd>西安交通大学 · 自动化本科</dd><dt>Period</dt><dd>2023.09 — 2027.06</dd><dt>Contact</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a><br /><a href={`tel:${profile.phone}`}>{profile.phone}</a></dd></dl></div><div class="profile-block reveal"><p class="section-label">Toolkit</p><div class="skill-cloud">{skills.map((skill) => <span>{skill}</span>)}</div></div><div class="profile-block reveal"><p class="section-label">Elsewhere</p><a class="github-link" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub / BaileyH-17 <span>↗</span></a></div></aside>
<div class="main-column"><section id="experience" class="experience-section reveal"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-label">Experience</p><h2>工程结果，<br />比漂亮的 demo 更重要。</h2></div><p>用可验证的指标描述工作：准确率、推理速度、内存占用，以及能否在真实硬件上稳定运行。</p></div><div class="experience-feature"><div class="feature-index">01</div><div><p class="project-eyebrow">ArexVision · Edge AI internship</p><h3>端侧 AI 部署工程师实习生</h3><p>参与海洋生物检测与分类边缘 AI 模型的端到端开发，覆盖训练策略、量化编译、C/C++ 前后处理、边缘板验证和本地 AI 平台建设。</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/edge-ai-deployment/">阅读完整经历 <span>→</span></a></div><time>2026.06 — 2026.09</time></div></section>
<section id="projects" class="projects-section"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="section-label">Selected projects</p><h2>研究与项目</h2></div><p>每个项目都保留一条独立路径，后续可以继续补充截图、架构图、代码和论文链接。</p></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.slice(1).map((project, index) => <ProjectCard project={project} index={index + 1} />)}</div></section></div></div></div></BaseLayout>
